# From sr-init (restored):
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/.tmp/

# Workspace-only paths. Every path is anchored with a leading "/" so it matches only at the workspace root (an
# unanchored "assets/" once silently dropped dist/assets/ from another project's repo).
/tmp/
/preview/
/.claude/
*.zip
*.log

# The capture evidence stays on disk but is NOT published. sr-init's note says to keep audit/raw as the evidence,
# and it IS kept, locally. But its 148 raw pages embed the live site's Google Maps API key (133 hits, found by
# `node tools/secret-scan.mjs --dir audit` on 2026-10-02), and this repository is public. The handoff zip strips
# these folders by default too (sr-package).
/audit/raw/
/audit/rendered/
/audit/capture/
/audit/css/
/audit/screens/
